# Shang-Chi and the Ten Rings' abilities with Shang-Chi gone (CR 113.7a, 400.7): its tenth +1/+1 counter is put by the
# turn-7 draw, and with that trigger on the stack Bot2 exiles it with Path to Exile. The trigger still resolves - Bot1
# draws five cards and gains 5 life - and the five "whenever you draw a card" triggers it then has put nothing on the
# Shang-Chi that left: it is in exile with no counters, nothing triggers a second time, and Bot1 is at 25.

